I think there might be some connection with activeRange using the selection. The P005 issues seem likely to occur after table operations, especially since it seems like the requests can still be current while the frame is updating. It’s possible that the action might use the stale range in the toolbar if it gets repeated quickly. I definitely need to run some tests and inspect the commands along with the controller APIs. Also, testing the existing table toolbar tests sounds like a plan.
